{"Bulk replay deletion job creation and model do not record who initiated the destructive operation, leaving no audit trail for mass replay deletion": 0.14192430675029755, "run_bulk_replay_delete_job() task does not verify that the job belongs to the organization/project it claims to delete from - retrieves job directly by ID without scoping checks, allowing potential cross-organization deletion if job ID is discovered": 0.32743749022483826, "When use-table-widget-visualization feature flag is enabled, TableWidgetVisualization receives hardcoded empty columns and table data instead of actual query results, causing empty table widgets": 0.9941613078117371, "Explore page parameter types and guards expect yAxes arrays while refactored Visualize class uses single yAxis string, causing type/runtime inconsistencies during URL serialization or deserialization": 0.8591485619544983, "Bulk replay deletion execution and Snuba query failures lack logs or metrics, making it difficult to monitor deletion throughput or diagnose failed/stalled deletion jobs": 0.2605745494365692, "TabularColumn.name field typed as TFields (string literal) but used with non-literal string values for display purposes, causing misleading type design and potential type errors": 0.17649701237678528, "useFeedbackSummary hook may access data.summary and data.numFeedbacksUsed when data is undefined/null, causing runtime error when query is complete but data is not defined": 0.9128169417381287}